---
/* src/pages/privacy.astro */
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <section class="legal-container">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <p>VoidCore Studios ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal data you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website, play our games (including <em>The Hidden One</em>), or interact with our community platforms.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect personal identification information from you in a variety of ways, including, but not limited to, when you subscribe to our newsletter, submit a message via our contact form, or apply for an open position on our careers board. This data may include your name, email address, alias, and professional history.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <p>The information we collect is utilized strictly to enhance your experience with VoidCore Studios. Specifically, we use it to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to direct inquiries, support requests, or career applications.</li>
        <li>Send development newsletters and exclusive playtest updates (only if opted-in).</li>
        <li>Monitor website performance and optimize user experience across modern browsers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Links & Services</h2>
      <p>Our website features links to external platforms such as Discord, Roblox, and YouTube. Please note that we do not control the privacy practices of these third-party environments. We encourage you to read their respective privacy statements when leaving our digital space.</p>

      <h2>4. Cookies & Analytical Data</h2>
      <p>We utilize standard browser cookies to understand general traffic flows and site navigation patterns. Cookies help keep our site responsive and ensure premium styling rules load efficiently on repetitive visits. You can disable cookies in your individual browser settings at any time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 800px; /* Reduced from max-width configuration to prioritize structural reading */
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 161, 178, 0.1);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--color-core-azure);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-core-azure);
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    list-style-type: square;
    margin-left: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-steel-gray);
  }

  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>